    "text": "AP14A1 Mid hiora fi\u00f0ra flyhte, & se mon \u00f0a gelefde Gode, & he w\u00e6s sungen on dea\u00f0 for Criste, & his\nAP18A1 On \u00f0one eahtateg\u00f0an d\u00e6g \u00f0\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6s halgan biscepes tid, sancte Eleutheri, & his\nAP18A3 He w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6re burge biscep \u00f0e is nemned Mechania, in Apulia \u00f0\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00f0e, ah he ge\u00f0rowade\nAP18A5 Adrianus se casere hine \u00f0reatade \u00f0\u00e6t he Criste wi\u00f0soce.\nAP18A6 \u00d0a he \u00f0\u00e6t ne walde, \u00f0a heht se casere gesponnan fiower wildo hors to scride, & hine\nAP18A9 \u00d0a cwom Godes engel of hiofonum, & gestillde \u00f0\u00e6m horssum, & hio gel\u00e6ddon \u00f0\u00e6t scrid on\nAP18A13 \u00d0a het se casere his huntan hine \u00f0\u00e6r gefeccan & hine mid sueorde ofslean.\nAP18A15 \u00d0a cwom stefn of hiofonum, & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Cym, min \u00f0eow Eleutherius, mine englas \u00f0ec l\u00e6da\u00f0\nAP18A17 \u00d0a feoll his modor ufan on his lichoman, & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Min sunu, gemyne \u00f0u mec on \u00f0\u00e6re\nAP18A18 And se casere hio heht gemartyrian.\nAP21A1 \u00f0on \u00f0e he tuelf gear \u00f0\u00e6r wunode \u00f0a eode he in \u00f0one gefean \u00f0\u00e6re ecan eadinesse.\nAP21A3 \u00d0\u00e6s \u00e6\u00f0elwaldes wunder w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6t he spr\u00e6c to his liorn\u00e6ra sumum, & \u00f0a feringa o\u00f0suigde he,\nAP21A5 \u00d0a fr\u00e6gn se his \u00f0egn hine for hwon he su\u00e6 ded, \u00f0a cu\u00f0\u00e6 he, Hu meahte ic bu somod ge in\nAP23A1 On \u00f0one \u00f0rio & tuenteg\u00f0an d\u00e6g \u00f0\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 sancte Iorius tid, \u00f0\u00e6s \u00e6\u00f0elan weres, \u00f0one\nAP23A5 \u00d0a he \u00f0a w\u00e6s l\u00e6ded to \u00f0\u00e6re beheafdunga, \u00f0a cuom fyr of heofonum, & forbernde \u00f0one\nAP23A7 Ond he sanctus Georgius him to Dryhtne geb\u00e6d, & \u00f0us cu\u00e6\u00f0, H\u00e6lende Crist, onfoh minum",
